{"先":[["先谢谢了。","xiān xiè xiè le ","Thanks in advance.","tatoeba:545880"],["谢谢您，先生。","xiè xiè nín  xiān shēng ","Thank you, sir.","tatoeba:710691"],["你先走吧。","nǐ xiān zǒu ba ","You go first.","hanzi-desk"]],"每":[["我每周日都在家。","wǒ měi zhōu rì dōu zài jiā ","I am always at home on Sundays.","tatoeba:10534485"],["爸爸每天写日记。","bà ba měi tiān xiě rì jì ","Father keeps a diary every day.","tatoeba:678024"],["每个人都看见了。","měi gè rén dōu kàn jiàn le ","Everybody saw it.","tatoeba:6150895"]],"次":[["这是第一次。","zhè shì dì yī cì ","This is the first time.","tatoeba:1227135"],["不会再有下次了。","bú huì zài yǒu xià cì le ","I won't do it again.","tatoeba:794242"],["你看这看了多少次？","nǐ kàn zhè kàn le duō shǎo cì ","How many times have you seen this?","tatoeba:5574440"]],"人":[["我们是人。","wǒ men shì rén ","We're people.","tatoeba:335262"],["那人是谁？","nà rén shì shuí ","Who is that person?","tatoeba:354121"],["有很多人。","yǒu hěn duō rén ","There were lots of people.","tatoeba:842484"]],"男":[["我是个男人。","wǒ shì gè nán rén ","I'm a man.","tatoeba:333655"],["我们是男孩。","wǒ men shì nán hái ","We're boys.","tatoeba:825895"],["你有男朋友吗？","nǐ yǒu nán péng yǒu ma ","Do you have a boyfriend?","tatoeba:13224704"]],"女":[["我是女人。","wǒ shì nǚ rén ","I'm a woman.","tatoeba:747591"],["他有三个女儿。","tā yǒu sān gè nǚ ér ","He has three daughters.","tatoeba:383300"],["他没有女朋友。","tā méi yǒu nǚ péng yǒu ","He has no girlfriend.","tatoeba:432313"]],"子":[["他没有孩子。","tā méi yǒu hái zi ","He has no children.","tatoeba:181028"],["这是我的儿子。","zhè shì wǒ de ér zi ","This is my son.","hanzi-desk"],["桌子上有一本书。","zhuō zi shàng yǒu yì běn shū ","There's a book on the table.","hanzi-desk"]],"爸":[["爸爸在哪？","bà ba zài nǎ ","Where's Daddy?","tatoeba:13119020"],["你是我爸吗？","nǐ shì wǒ bà ma ","Are you my father?","tatoeba:9972811"],["她爸是日本人。","tā bà shì rì běn rén ","Her father is Japanese.","tatoeba:344828"]],"妈":[["你妈妈呢？","nǐ mā ma ne ","Where's your mom?","tatoeba:10966817"],["你爸妈知道你在哪儿吗？","nǐ bà mā zhī dào nǐ zài nǎ r ma ","Do your parents know where you are?","ta