"I'm a friend.","tatoeba:13825930"],["有朋自远方来，不亦乐乎？","yǒu péng zì yuǎn fāng lái  bú yì lè hū ","When a friend comes from afar, is that not delightful?","tatoeba:406455"],["他是我最好的朋友。","tā shì wǒ zuì hǎo de péng yǒu ","He's my best friend.","hanzi-desk"]],"友":[["我是朋友。","wǒ shì péng yǒu ","I'm a friend.","tatoeba:13825930"],["对他人要友善。","duì tā rén yào yǒu shàn ","Be nice to others.","tatoeba:2188491"],["她要和男友分手了。","tā yào hé nán yǒu fēn shǒu le ","She is going to part from her boyfriend.","tatoeba:340088"]],"夫":[["我父亲是个大夫。","wǒ fù qīn shì gè dài fu ","My father's a doctor.","tatoeba:787604"],["她以前是第一夫人。","tā yǐ qián shì dì yī fū rén ","She was the First Lady.","tatoeba:4764655"],["她的丈夫是医生。","tā de zhàng fu shì yī shēng ","Her husband is a doctor.","hanzi-desk"]],"妻":[["她是我妻子。","tā shì wǒ qī zi ","She's my wife.","tatoeba:1325183"],["这对夫妻手牵手走路。","zhè duì fū qī shǒu qiān shǒu zǒu lù ","The couple is walking hand in hand.","tatoeba:895136"],["他介绍了他的未婚妻。","tā jiè shào le tā de wèi hūn qī ","He introduced his fiancée.","tatoeba:10360655"]],"爷":[["我爷爷每天吃药。","wǒ yé ye měi tiān chī yào ","My grandfather takes medicine every day.","tatoeba:1216089"],["老天爷啊！","lǎo tiān yé a ","Oh, my God!","tatoeba:1185718"],["爷爷每天早上去公园。","yé ye měi tiān zǎo shàng qù gōng yuán ","Grandpa goes to the park every morning.","hanzi-desk"]],"奶":[["奶茶在哪里？","nǎi chá zài nǎ lǐ ","Where is the milk tea?","tatoeba:482367"],["今天早上吃酸奶。","jīn tiān zǎo shàng chī suān nǎi ","I ate yoghurt this morning.","tatoeba:6284431"],["我们没奶油了。","wǒ men méi nǎi yóu le ","We have run out of cream.","tatoeba:10695964"]],"祖":[["我祖母很老了。","wǒ zǔ mǔ hěn lǎo le ","My grandmother is very old.","tatoeba:9969255"],["祖父常常边看报纸边点头。","zǔ fù cháng cháng biān kàn bào zhǐ biān diǎn tóu ","My grandfather often nods over his newspaper.","tatoeba:361699"],["他们为祖国而战斗。","tā men wèi zǔ guó ér zhàn dòu ","They fight for their country.","tatoeba:1366198"]],"亲":[["我没亲他。","wǒ méi qīn tā ","I didn't kiss him.","tatoeba:9968939"],["父亲不在家。","fù qīn bú zài jiā ","Dad isn't home.","tatoeba:339257"],["这是我母亲。","zhè shì wǒ mǔ qīn ","This is my mother.","tatoeba:796923"]],"孩":[["他没有孩子。","tā méi yǒu hái zi ","He has no children.","tatoeba:181028"],["我们是男孩。","wǒ men shì nán hái ","We're boys.","tatoeba:825895"],["这个女孩是谁？","zhè ge nǚ hái shì shuí ","Who is this girl?","tatoeba:502766"]],"老":[["我是老师。","wǒ shì lǎo shī ","I'm a teacher.","tatoeba:1050441"],["我祖母很老了。","wǒ zǔ mǔ hěn lǎo le ","My grandmother is very old.","tatoeba:9969255"],["这位老人是我的爷爷。","zhè wèi lǎo rén shì wǒ de yé ye ","This old man is my grandfather.","hanzi-desk"]],"师":[["我是老师。","wǒ shì lǎo shī ","I'm a teacher.","tatoeba:1050441"],["他是教师。","tā shì jiào shī ","He's a teacher.","tatoeba:7768344"],["理发师为他理了头发。","lǐ fà shī wèi tā lǐ le tóu fa ","The barber gave him a haircut.","tatoeba:868434"]],"学":[["你是学生。","nǐ shì xué shēng ","You are a student.","tatoeba:1163561"],["学学你姐姐。","xué xué nǐ jiě jie ","Follow your sister's example.","tatoeba:349704"],["你数学好吗？","nǐ shù xué hǎo ma ","Are you good at math?","tatoeba:472397"]],"生":[["你是学生。","nǐ shì xué shēng ","You are a student.","tatoeba:1163561"],["谢谢您，先生。","xiè xiè nín  xiān shēng ","Thank you, sir.","tatoeba:710691"],["明天是我生日。","míng tiān shì wǒ shēng rì ","Tomorrow is my birthday.","tatoeba:844551"]]}
